do Global.stop_movement()
do Global.cam_switch_to_static(1)
Veska: [portrait=simper]We've arrived at the town square.!
Veska: [portrait=simper]The social core of the common people, where the threat under which the clergy reigns was forgotten years ago. 
Veska: [portrait=simper]Both monks and believers now act more out of inertia than out of fear or conviction.
Veska: [portrait=simper]They regard the rites that protect the city from the threats mentioned in the scriptures as mere tradition.
do Dialogic.start_timeline("check_transition_TL")
